"><TITLE>Shaman for Hire - www.ezboard.com</TITLE></HEAD><BODY TEXT=#000000 BGCOLOR=#336699 LINK=#ffffff VLINK=#ffffff ALINK=#ffffff ><CENTER><CENTER><A HREF=http://www.deusfactum.com><IMG SRC=http://www.deusfactum.com/images/bbs/df.gif BORDER=0></A><P></CENTER><BR><TABLE WIDTH=95%><TR><TD><B><A HREF=http://pub14.ezboard.com/bdeusfactum><FONT FACE="Verdana,Arial" SIZE=2>Deus Factum</FONT></A></B><BR>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<B>> <A HREF=http://pub14.ezboard.com/fdeusfactumgeneral><FONT FACE="Verdana,Arial" SIZE=2>General</FONT></A></B><BR><B>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<B>> <FONT FACE="Verdana,Arial" SIZE=2>Shaman for Hire</FONT></B></TD><TD ALIGN=RIGHT><A HREF=http://pub14.ezboard.com/fdeusfactumgeneral.showAddTopicScreenFromWeb><IMG SRC=http://www.deusfactum.com/images/bbs/df-nt.gif border=0></A>&nbsp; &nbsp; <A HREF=http://pub14.ezboard.com/fdeusfactumgeneral.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=199.topic><IMG SRC=http://www.deusfactum.com/images/bbs/df-ar.gif border=0></A></TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN=LEFT></TD><TD ALIGN=RIGHT><A HREF=http://pub14.ezboard.com/fdeusfactumgeneral.showMessage?topicID=205.topic><FONT FACE="Verdana,Arial" SIZE=1><< Prev Topic</FONT></A> &nbsp;<A HREF=http://pub14.ezboard.com/fdeusfactumgeneral.showMessage?topicID=207.topic><FONT FACE="Verdana,Arial" SIZE=1>Next Topic >></FONT></A> </TD></TR></TABLE><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="95%"><tr><td bgcolor=#000000><table border=0 width=100% cellpadding=5 cellspacing=1><TR><TD valign=top BGCOLOR=#000000><B><FONT FACE="Verdana,Arial" SIZE=1 COLOR=#ffffff>Author</FONT><B></TD><TD valign=top BGCOLOR=#000000><B><FONT FACE="Verdana,Arial" SIZE=1 COLOR=#ffffff>Comment</FONT><B></FONT></TD></TR><TR BGCOLOR=#999999><TD NOWRAP width=20% valign=top align=left><B><FONT FACE="Verdana,Arial" SIZE=2><A HREF=http://pub14.ezboard.com/uxanalor23.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Xanalor23</A></FONT></B><BR><FONT FACE="Verdana,Arial" SIZE=1>Registered User</FONT><BR><FONT FACE="Verdana,Arial" SIZE=1>(</FONT><FONT FACE="Verdana,Arial" SIZE=1 COLOR=#000000>3/9/01</FONT> <FONT FACE="Verdana,Arial" SIZE=1 COLOR=#000000>10:02:26 am</FONT><FONT FACE="Verdana,Arial" SIZE=1>)<BR></FONT></TD><TD VALIGN=TOP ALIGN=LEFT><B><FONT SIZE=2 FACE="Verdana,Arial">Shaman for Hire</font></B><HR><FONT SIZE=2 FACE="Verdana,Arial">SINGLE WHITE MALE BARBARIAN seeks lively company. Female barbarians with a propensity for dying preferred, diminutive clerics and paladins also acceptable. Likes: Alcohol, snowy days and Bixie Crunchies. Dislikes: Nipple rings, lava and ogre masseuses named Gretta. Don't ask.<br>
<br>
But I digress...<br>
<br>
To the many fine members of Deus Factum who don't know me, my name is Xanlaor the, well, that's it. Just Xanalor. I'm currently a 44th-level shaman and a member of the presitigious Clan Icewind, but when my latest Norrathian hiatus ends, I will be looking to join a smaller, cozier guild. That, and I miss hanging out with the old beta crew. *sniff* And now that I hear you're all leaving the lands of the Rathe behind, I feel compelled to follow...<br>
<br>
My play time is limited these days, but I wanted to get an idea of what kind of membership guidelines you have and how one might obtain a spot in your fine organization, if one were so inclined.<br>
<br>
If this information is available elsewhere on the site and I missed it, you'll have to forgive me. Afterall, I AM a barbarian. Technically, I can't even read the letters I'm typing.<br>
<br>
Of course, I'll want to spend some time getting to know those of you I don't once I get back into the swing of things. For now, I just wanted to get an idea of what would be involved in taking the next step. Thanks in advance for any replies, and I look forward to flexing my blue=tattooed chest for your lovely ladies--and your gnomes too, if they're into that sort of thing.<br>
<br>
   -Xanalor<br>
</font><P><P><i><FONT FACE="Verdana,Arial" SIZE=1>Edited by: <A HREF=http://pub14.ezboard.com/uxanalor23.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Xanalor23</A> at: 3/9/01 2:22:12 pm</FONT><br></i></TD></TR><TR BGCOLOR=#aaaaaa><TD NOWRAP width=20% valign=top align=left><B><FONT FACE="Verdana,Arial" SIZE=2><A HREF=http://pub14.ezboard.com/utracker106.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Tracker106</A></FONT></B><BR><FONT FACE="Verdana,Arial" SIZE=1>Registered User</FONT><BR><FONT FACE="Verdana,Arial" SIZE=1>(</FONT><FONT FACE="Verdana,Arial" SIZE=1 COLOR=#000000>3/9/01</FONT> <FONT FACE="Verdana,Arial" SIZE=1 COLOR=#000000>11:06:01 am</FONT><FONT FACE="Verdana,Arial" SIZE=1>)<BR></FONT></TD><TD VALIGN=TOP ALIGN=LEFT><B><FONT SIZE=2 FACE="Verdana,Arial">Re: Shaman for Hire</font></B><HR><FONT SIZE=2 FACE="Verdana,Arial">Falan here my old friend of the frozen north.  I would be more than honored to sponser you with many others should you choose to join our family.  Having known &amp; grown with you all the way back to level 6 or so I know you would be a valuable addition to our family. I have much missed you with your good humor &amp; unflappable disposition; even when our groups foolishness leads to the inevitable CRs (we are much better now, they now longer occur hourly!  ;-) )  please do a quick who all of any of our members in range to join our parties, the more that get to know you will join Borgon; Glaeni, Kilgear &amp; I in digging in our hooks to make sure you don't get away! Looking forward to working with you to make sure this happens my friend.  See you soon I hope.</font><P><P><i></i></TD></TR><TR BGCOLOR=#999999><TD NOWRAP width=20% valign=top align=left><B><FONT FACE="Verdana,Arial" SIZE=2><A HREF=http://pub14.ezboard.com/ukardius.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Kardius</A></FONT></B><BR><FONT FACE="Verdana,Arial" SIZE=1>Registered User</FONT><BR><FONT FACE="Verdana,Arial" SIZE=1>(</FONT><FONT FACE="Verdana,Arial" SIZE=1 COLOR=#000000>3/9/01</FONT> <FONT FACE="Verdana,Arial" SIZE=1 COLOR=#000000>3:20:14 pm</FONT><FONT FACE="Verdana,Arial" SIZE=1>)<BR></FONT><BR><img src=http://www.geocities.com/kardius_eq/shield.jpg WIDTH=60 HEIGHT=60></TD><TD VALIGN=TOP ALIGN=LEFT><B><FONT SIZE=2 FACE="Verdana,Arial">Re: Shaman for Hire</font></B><HR><FONT SIZE=2 FACE="Verdana,Arial">No Nipple Rings bah you suck <!--EZCODE EMOTICON START :evil --><img src=http://www.ezboard.com/intl/aenglish/images/emoticons/devil.gif ALT=":evil"><!--EZCODE EMOTICON END--> </font><P><P><i></i></TD></TR><TR BGCOLOR=#aaaaaa><TD NOWRAP width=20% valign=top align=left><B><FONT FACE="Verdana,Arial" SIZE=2><A HREF=http://pub14.ezboard.com/udauldon.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Dauldon</A></FONT></B><BR><FONT FACE="Verdana,Arial" SIZE=1>Guild Leader</FONT><BR><FONT FACE="Verdana,Arial" SIZE=1>(</FONT><FONT FACE="Verdana,Arial" SIZE=1 COLOR=#000000>3/10/01</FONT> <FONT FACE="Verdana,Arial" SIZE=1 COLOR=#000000>1:06:14 pm</FONT><FONT FACE="Verdana,Arial" SIZE=1>)<BR></FONT><BR><img src=http://www.geocities.com/Area51/Quasar/7694/Other/DauldonImg.jpg width='100' heigth='100'></TD><TD VALIGN=TOP ALIGN=LEFT><B><FONT SIZE=2 FACE="Verdana,Arial">Re: Shaman for Hire</font></B><HR><FONT SIZE=2 FACE="Verdana,Arial">It be a long time me friend, since I remember seein' yer name.  The website doesn't have anythin' (currently) to give interested people an idea o how to join.  However, it will soon, fer now let me say the ebst way to join is to group with us and get to know us and fer all o us to get to know ye.<br>
<br>
E-mail me at gm@deusfactum.com if'in ye have any more questions.<br>
<br>
</font><P><hr WIDTH="100%">
